{
  "id": "spongebob-squarepants---1x04---bubblestand---ripped-pants",
  "title": "SpongeBob SquarePants - 1x04 - Bubblestand - Ripped Pants",
  "sourceFilename": "SpongeBob SquarePants - 1x04 - Bubblestand - Ripped Pants.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-25T22:16:32.195Z",
  "lineCount": 309,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "SUB BY : DENI AUROR@ https://aurorarental.blogspot.com/ Are you ready, kids?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 10,
      "endMs": 9311
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Aye, aye, Captain!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 9411,
      "endMs": 11246
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "I can't hear you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 11346,
      "endMs": 12647
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Aye, aye, Captain!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 12747,
      "endMs": 14449
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "* oh...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 14549,
      "endMs": 17619
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "* who lives in a pineapple under the sea? * * Spongebob Squarepants! * * absorbent and yellow and porous is he. * * Spongebob Squarepants! * * if nautical nonsense be something you wish... * * Spongebob Squarepants! * * then drop on the deck and flop like a fish. * * Spongebob Squarepants! * * ready? Spongebob Squarepants! * * Spongebob Squarepants!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 17719,
      "endMs": 38807
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "* Spongebob Squarepants!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 38907,
      "endMs": 39808
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "* Spongebob Squarepants!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 39908,
      "endMs": 42277
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "What a wonderful day.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 74109,
      "endMs": 76445
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "The sun is out, the water is shimmering Scallops are chirping.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 76545,
      "endMs": 81716
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "So peaceful.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 81816,
      "endMs": 84153
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Can we lower the volume, please!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 91326,
      "endMs": 93428
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "I can't work with all that racket going on.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 93528,
      "endMs": 96565
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Oh, sure thing, Squidward.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 96665,
      "endMs": 98200
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Right, hmm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 98300,
      "endMs": 100469
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 100569,
      "endMs": 102237
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "And now for some soothing sounds from Squidward's clarinet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 117852,
      "endMs": 122757
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Thank you, thank you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 122857,
      "endMs": 124426
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "I thought i... huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 136771,
      "endMs": 139774
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Hey, Squidward, want to blow some bubbles?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 139874,
      "endMs": 142711
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Only 25 cents.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 142811,
      "endMs": 144246
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "Oh, right, like i would spend a moment of my time Blowing bubbles.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 144346,
      "endMs": 150252
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Uh-Huh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 150352,
      "endMs": 151120
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Oh, please!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 151220,
      "endMs": 152487
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "I mean, who in the world would pay to blow bubbles?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 152587,
      "endMs": 155824
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Good morning.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 157192,
      "endMs": 159961
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "Oh, boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 162397,
      "endMs": 163465
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Good morning to you, sir.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 163565,
      "endMs": 164966
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "Would you care to blow a bubble?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 165134,
      "endMs": 167001
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Oh, how much is it?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 167136,
      "endMs": 169371
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Only a quarter.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 169471,
      "endMs": 170605
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Sounds reasonable.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 170705,
      "endMs": 172307
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Uh... i'm going to need to borrow a quarter.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 172407,
      "endMs": 176945
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "Sure thing, Patrick.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 177045,
      "endMs": 178513
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Ah! One quarter.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 178613,
      "endMs": 181716
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Thank you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 185820,
      "endMs": 186755
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "Business is booming.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 188022,
      "endMs": 189291
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "How did i ever get surrounded by such loser neighbors?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 192894,
      "endMs": 197166
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "One bubble wand, dipped and ready to go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 201203,
      "endMs": 205073
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Ooh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 205174,
      "endMs": 206208
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Could i interest you in some lessons?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 241443,
      "endMs": 243512
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Only 25 cents.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 243612,
      "endMs": 244546
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Uh... very well, then.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 244646,
      "endMs": 248317
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Hey, sponge, can i borrow another quarter?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 248417,
      "endMs": 251553
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Thanks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 253021,
      "endMs": 254223
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Okay, Patrick, it's all in the technique.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 254289,
      "endMs": 256591
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "First go like this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 256691,
      "endMs": 258493
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Spin around-- Stop!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 258593,
      "endMs": 259894
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Double-Take three times-- One, two, three.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 259994,
      "endMs": 264098
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Then pelvic thrust.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 264233,
      "endMs": 266401
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Whoo!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 266501,
      "endMs": 268102
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Whoo!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 268237,
      "endMs": 269704
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "Stop on your right foot.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 269804,
      "endMs": 271039
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Don't forget it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 271139,
      "endMs": 272307
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Now it's time to bring it around town.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 272407,
      "endMs": 275744
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Bring it around town.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 275844,
      "endMs": 278813
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Then you do this Then this and this, then that and this And that and this and then...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 278913,
      "endMs": 285820
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Ooh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 294663,
      "endMs": 296731
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Ah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 297699,
      "endMs": 299000
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "Ah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 300969,
      "endMs": 303137
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 313982,
      "endMs": 316017
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 325594,
      "endMs": 327662
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "And now... with two hands.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 328663,
      "endMs": 331866
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "It's a giraffe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 337772,
      "endMs": 340208
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "Excuse me, sir, but we are close...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 370038,
      "endMs": 372341
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Don't give me any of that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 372407,
      "endMs": 373675
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "How could you two possibly make all this noise Just blowing bubbles?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 373775,
      "endMs": 377746
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "We're not just blowing bubbles; we're making bubble art.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 377846,
      "endMs": 381416
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Watch carefully.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 381516,
      "endMs": 383051
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "First go like this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 383151,
      "endMs": 385153
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "Spin around-- Stop!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 385253,
      "endMs": 387055
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "Double-Take three times-- One, two, three.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 387155,
      "endMs": 389958
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "Then pelvic thrust.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 390058,
      "endMs": 391926
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Whoo!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 392026,
      "endMs": 393395
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Whoo!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 393495,
      "endMs": 394663
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "Stop on your right foot.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 394763,
      "endMs": 396365
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Don't forget it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 396431,
      "endMs": 397366
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "Now it's time To bring it around town.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 397432,
      "endMs": 400802
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Bring it around town.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 400902,
      "endMs": 404573
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Then you do this, then this And this, then that and this and that and this and then...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 404673,
      "endMs": 410044
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "That's not art.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 422223,
      "endMs": 423425
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "That's just annoying.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 423525,
      "endMs": 425394
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "Blowing bubbles.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 425494,
      "endMs": 426895
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "That's the lamest idea i have ever heard.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 426995,
      "endMs": 430999
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "You should be ashamed of yourself.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 432801,
      "endMs": 436405
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "Bubbles.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 436438,
      "endMs": 437972
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Art.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 439808,
      "endMs": 441743
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Bubbles.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 441843,
      "endMs": 443645
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "Ridiculous.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 443745,
      "endMs": 445480
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "That'll be 25 cents, sir.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 453254,
      "endMs": 454623
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "Whoa, what?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 454723,
      "endMs": 455990
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 456090,
      "endMs": 457492
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Who would pay 25 cents to blow bubbles?!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 457592,
      "endMs": 460929
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "We also offer lessons for beginners.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 461029,
      "endMs": 463297
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Beginners?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 463432,
      "endMs": 464265
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "What could be more simple Than blowing a stupid bubble?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 464433,
      "endMs": 468870
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Here's your 25 cents.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 468970,
      "endMs": 472607
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "Watch and learn.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 475777,
      "endMs": 478613
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Uh... wait, wait, wait.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 480482,
      "endMs": 481950
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "One more time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 484686,
      "endMs": 485787
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "Here, wait, wait.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 485887,
      "endMs": 486855
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "Whoa!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 493562,
      "endMs": 494696
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Aah, just a mere warm-Up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 496765,
      "endMs": 500268
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Hey, Squidward, remember the technique.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 507476,
      "endMs": 509911
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "Technique-- You do this and this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 510011,
      "endMs": 512481
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Step back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 512547,
      "endMs": 514015
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "Technique, Squidward.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 514115,
      "endMs": 516217
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Spin around like this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 516317,
      "endMs": 518352
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Over here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 519488,
      "endMs": 520489
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "One, two, yeah, three...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 520522,
      "endMs": 522824
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "The pelvic whoo!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 522924,
      "endMs": 524493
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Don't forget the \"whoo\"!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 526995,
      "endMs": 529163
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Listen to sponge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 531600,
      "endMs": 533768
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Technique!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 533868,
      "endMs": 534803
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Technique! Technique!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 534903,
      "endMs": 536605
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "Technique!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 536705,
      "endMs": 538139
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "Technique! Technique!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 538239,
      "endMs": 539508
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "Technique! Technique!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 539541,
      "endMs": 540675
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "Tech...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 540775,
      "endMs": 541710
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "You're not doing the technique.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 541810,
      "endMs": 545313
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Technique! Technique!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 545413,
      "endMs": 546715
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Technique, technique, technique, technique, technique!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 546815,
      "endMs": 550084
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "First i do this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 550184,
      "endMs": 551920
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "Spin around, stop.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 552020,
      "endMs": 553822
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "Double-Take three times.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 553922,
      "endMs": 555323
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "And here we go, pelvic thrust.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 555423,
      "endMs": 557792
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "Whoo!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 557892,
      "endMs": 559528
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Whoo!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 559661,
      "endMs": 560595
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "Oh, stop on your right foot.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 560695,
      "endMs": 563732
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "Don't forget it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 563832,
      "endMs": 564733
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "Then bring it around town.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 564833,
      "endMs": 567035
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "And a little of this, a little of that A little of this, this, that, that, that, that, that, then...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 567135,
      "endMs": 573708
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "Wow! Wow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 579848,
      "endMs": 581750
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "All right, squid!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 584819,
      "endMs": 586555
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "That was so good!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 586588,
      "endMs": 588256
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "Squid is number one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 588356,
      "endMs": 590992
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "I really did it, didn't i?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 591092,
      "endMs": 592293
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "Yeah-- You guys didn't blow anything like that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 592393,
      "endMs": 595930
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "Nope.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 596030,
      "endMs": 597031
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "Now, that's a bubble.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 597131,
      "endMs": 598900
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "You said it, Squidward.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 599000,
      "endMs": 600334
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "See, it is all in the technique.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 600434,
      "endMs": 602637
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "Yeah, technique.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 602737,
      "endMs": 604305
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Technique? Huh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 604405,
      "endMs": 605907
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "Spongebob, you don't think i created That... beautiful work of art With your help.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 606007,
      "endMs": 614115
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "Come on, it's in my genes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 615483,
      "endMs": 618486
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "Squid's got genes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 618587,
      "endMs": 620622
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "Squid's got genes...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 620722,
      "endMs": 621823
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "Thank you, thank you, thank you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 621923,
      "endMs": 624659
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "Squidward, Squidward, Squidward, Squidward...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 632967,
      "endMs": 637038
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "Squidward, Squidward, Squidward...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 637138,
      "endMs": 638907
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "Squidward, Squidward...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 639007,
      "endMs": 640775
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "I rock.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 640875,
      "endMs": 643578
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "Squidward, Squidward...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 643678,
      "endMs": 645747
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "Squidward, Squidward, Squidward, Squidward, Squidward, Squidward.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 645847,
      "endMs": 649884
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "Squidward, Squidward, Squidward, Squidward, Squidward, Squidward.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 649984,
      "endMs": 655657
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "Squidward, Squidward, Squidward, Squidward.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 655757,
      "endMs": 659227
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "Squid, squid, Squidward! Squid, squid, Squidward!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 659327,
      "endMs": 661630
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "Squid, squid, Squidward! Squid, squid, Squidward!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 661730,
      "endMs": 665033
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "Squidward, Squidward Squidward, Squidward...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 665133,
      "endMs": 670171
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "Squidward...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 670271,
      "endMs": 671706
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "Squidward!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 671806,
      "endMs": 673975
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "Squidward!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 674075,
      "endMs": 675844
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "Squidward! Squidward!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 675944,
      "endMs": 678279
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "Hello, my friends.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 681482,
      "endMs": 683051
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "You are looking at a...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 683151,
      "endMs": 685053
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "Squidward...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 685153,
      "endMs": 688322
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "Genius.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 688422,
      "endMs": 690124
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "Wow! Wow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 695764,
      "endMs": 697999
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "Ahh... goo lagoon-- A stinky mud puddle to you and me But to the inhabitants of bikini bottom A wonderful, stinky mud puddle.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 729960,
      "endMs": 740971
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "What a great day!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 742773,
      "endMs": 744709
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "Hey, Sandy, look!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 746544,
      "endMs": 748278
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "I'm Sandy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 748378,
      "endMs": 750080
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "Hey, Sandy, who am i?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 753784,
      "endMs": 756086
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "Hello, Spongebob.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 759724,
      "endMs": 761258
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "Could you keep it down?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 761358,
      "endMs": 763060
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "I'm trying to be boring.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 763160,
      "endMs": 764795
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "Spongebob.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 766764,
      "endMs": 768365
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "Did anyone order 20 pepperoni and sand pizzas?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 771035,
      "endMs": 773370
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "Hey, Sandy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 778008,
      "endMs": 779143
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "Hey, Spongebob.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 779243,
      "endMs": 780545
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "Hey, Larry.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 780578,
      "endMs": 781612
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "You guys want to go lift some weights?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 781712,
      "endMs": 785550
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "Sure.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 785650,
      "endMs": 786784
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "Well, come on, Spongebob.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 786884,
      "endMs": 789720
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "Coming.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 789820,
      "endMs": 791689
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "Give it a try, Sandy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 803568,
      "endMs": 804969
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "Ee-Yah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 810040,
      "endMs": 811275
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "Whoa!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 813944,
      "endMs": 815279
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "Good job, Sandy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 815379,
      "endMs": 816581
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "That's about enough for today.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 816647,
      "endMs": 818215
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "How about a little more weight?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 818315,
      "endMs": 820417
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "Observe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 820585,
      "endMs": 821919
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "Yah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 826924,
      "endMs": 828125
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "All right, stand back, everyone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 834599,
      "endMs": 838002
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "Y'all watch this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 846677,
      "endMs": 849246
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Ee-Yah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 849346,
      "endMs": 850648
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "Way to go, Larry!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 858623,
      "endMs": 860290
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "Could i borrow a couple of these?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 865630,
      "endMs": 867231
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "Mm-Hmm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 867331,
      "endMs": 868666
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "And now, with the addition Of two-- Count' em, two-- Marshmallows.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 873203,
      "endMs": 878843
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "That was too funny.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 930961,
      "endMs": 932997
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "You are hilarious!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 933097,
      "endMs": 936200
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "Ain't he the funniest little sponge You ever saw?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 936300,
      "endMs": 940137
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "Anybody up for some volleyball?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 941839,
      "endMs": 944775
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "I got it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 950748,
      "endMs": 952216
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "Incoming.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 958589,
      "endMs": 961626
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "Oops!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 965863,
      "endMs": 967064
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "I guess i ripped my pants again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 967164,
      "endMs": 970067
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "Once again, dude, you have split my sides.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 975473,
      "endMs": 979109
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "Hey, Sandy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 989554,
      "endMs": 990821
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "How about throwing it to me?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 990921,
      "endMs": 992390
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "Okay, here it comes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 992490,
      "endMs": 995660
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "I could use a hand here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1001031,
      "endMs": 1002199
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "You okay, Spongebob?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1006371,
      "endMs": 1007938
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "I guess so... except i ripped my pants!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1008038,
      "endMs": 1011108
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "You still caught it, dude.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1016481,
      "endMs": 1019016
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "May i help you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1021419,
      "endMs": 1023020
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "I'll take a banana split.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1023120,
      "endMs": 1024789
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "Uh... we don't have that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1024889,
      "endMs": 1026123
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "That's okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1026223,
      "endMs": 1027224
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "I already... split my pants, get it?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1027392,
      "endMs": 1030428
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "Tee-Hee.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1032096,
      "endMs": 1033230
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "Anything else?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1033398,
      "endMs": 1034465
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "How about...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1034599,
      "endMs": 1036033
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "Ripple?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1036133,
      "endMs": 1036967
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "No, thanks, already got one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1038703,
      "endMs": 1041005
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "Is that a burger you're eating?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1046577,
      "endMs": 1049747
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "Why, yes, it is.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1049847,
      "endMs": 1051148
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "You know what would go good with that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1051248,
      "endMs": 1053518
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "No, what?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1053618,
      "endMs": 1055052
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "Ripped... pants.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1055152,
      "endMs": 1057855
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "Ripped pants a la mode.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1062059,
      "endMs": 1064895
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "Delivery!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1067432,
      "endMs": 1070234
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "Did you order 20 cases of ripped pants?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1070334,
      "endMs": 1073571
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "Surf's up in the goo lagoon.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1079076,
      "endMs": 1081712
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "And here comes Larry, doing his trademark lay-Back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1085349,
      "endMs": 1088719
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "There goes Sandy, hanging ten... fingers, that is.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1090120,
      "endMs": 1094559
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "There goes Spongebob...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1094659,
      "endMs": 1096260
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "Ripping his pants again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1097495,
      "endMs": 1099129
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "Hey, look!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1106504,
      "endMs": 1107572
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "A cardboard box washed up on the beach.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1107672,
      "endMs": 1110941
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "Holy fish paste!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1112477,
      "endMs": 1114178
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "It's a guy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1114278,
      "endMs": 1116614
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "Why?!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1121351,
      "endMs": 1122152
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "Why?!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1122252,
      "endMs": 1124021
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "Why?!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1124121,
      "endMs": 1128158
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "Spongebob!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1128258,
      "endMs": 1130227
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "Come closer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1131496,
      "endMs": 1133998
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "I need...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1134098,
      "endMs": 1135633
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "I need...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1135733,
      "endMs": 1136867
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "What do you need?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1138068,
      "endMs": 1139236
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "A tailor.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1141972,
      "endMs": 1144509
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "Because i ripped my pants.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1145576,
      "endMs": 1147177
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "That kind of stuff is uncalled for.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1150715,
      "endMs": 1152917
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "What is that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1153017,
      "endMs": 1154218
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "That wasn't funny, Spongebob.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1155886,
      "endMs": 1158055
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "Y'all had me worried sick.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1158155,
      "endMs": 1160525
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "Dude.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1163828,
      "endMs": 1165162
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "Spongebob, you're losing them!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1170434,
      "endMs": 1172603
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "Think! Your public's waiting.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1172703,
      "endMs": 1174739
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "Let's see...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1176006,
      "endMs": 1176874
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "\"Lifting weights-- Big laugh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1176974,
      "endMs": 1178976
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "\"Frisbee in face-- Kills.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1179076,
      "endMs": 1180911
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "\"Surfing-- Knocks 'em dead.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1181011,
      "endMs": 1183047
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
